## About Lumin Art

Lumin Art is a design-led lighting studio created under the legacy of Light House, a lighting company with more than two decades of industry experience.

Our focus is not just supplying lighting fixtures but shaping how light interacts with architecture. We collaborate with architects and interior designers to create lighting systems that enhance spatial experience, mood, and functionality.

From architectural lighting planning to custom decorative fixtures, our approach blends technical precision with artistic expression.

